          "content": "{\n  \"name\": \"Kumārī Rati — Teaching Profile\",\n  \"keys\": [\"Kumari Rati teach\", \"Kumari Rati skills\", \"Kumārī Rati kink\"],\n  \"content\": \"Kumārī Rati is the primary initiate and seeker of Antaḥpura. She teaches:\\n\\nPrimary Teaching: Vicarious Ego-Bhanga\\n\\nTeaching Path: Curiosity → Experience → Documentation → Transformation\\n\\nWhat the Player Learns:\\n- Exploration of desire through yoga\\n- The art of breaking others' egos\\n- Alpha subbing dynamics\\n- Self-discovery through experience\\n- Documentation of one's journey\\n\\nAdditional Teachings: Yoga, Forms, Alpha Subbing\\n\\nTeaching Style: Exploratory — guiding the player to discover through experience.\\n\\nKumārī Rati teaches through demonstration, challenge, and poetic reflection.\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"insertion_order\": 0,\n  \"case_sensitive\": false,\n  \"priority\": 100,\n  \"extensions\": {\n    \"chub\": {\n      \"invisible_to_player\": false\n    }\n  }\n}",
